# GhostGuard AI Configuration (Optional)
# The core pipeline is deterministic and runs offline with 0 external API dependencies.
# Optional environment overrides:

# Disable OCR caching if re-extracting:
# GHOSTGUARD_NO_CACHE=1

# Custom OCR cache directory (default is .cache/ocr):
# GHOSTGUARD_CACHE_DIR=.cache/ocr

# Optional external LLM key if integrating custom VLM/LLM extractors:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_key_here
